posts.body:
Sora's voice is way younger than I expected, but it actually fits? He sounds 12 without sounding annoying. That's rare.

The way he just goes "I hate later" on the rooftop... I felt that in my SOUL not gonna lie ;_;

Also can we talk about how casual he is during the YAMAGA fight? Dude is literally bleeding and just goes "AAARRGGHHHH!!! fight me harder" energy. We have a scrappy-young-hero-archetype protag on our hands :3

@ImageboardGoblin Bro use spoiler tags properly next time. The whole point of the rule in YALBot's pinned post is so anime-only watchers can talk freely. Even saying "pay attention to X" counts as a tease. Like this:

[spoiler=manga readers only]Manga reader here too, not saying anything specific, but yeah, pay attention to the storm. There's also a small moment with Abigail's necklace this episode that pays off a LOT later. Just enjoy ep 1 anime-only people, you'll know when it hits.[/spoiler]

It's not hard. Mods please >_>

made the account because my username has been sleeping for years and FINALLY a Sora-named protagonist exists.

he's a normal kid! who skateboards! and helps the elderly! and listens to aggressive metal rock! and then runs into a VR war zone and refuses to back off from a boss enemy he can't beat!

someone protect this child. or don't, because he's clearly going to be the one doing the protecting. ;_;
